--- !u!114 &2040050184
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2040050182}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'BREATHE, DIVE, DRIVE

    Four snorkel-equipped trucks race three flooded
    muddy courses. Up to four local humans; AI fills missing slots. MOVE drives,
    steers, brakes and reverses. HOLD ACTION to DIVE: bounded downward force reduces
    buoyancy so your tyres grip the trench bottom and fit under marked logs. Release
    to rise; a gentle bounded paddle force preserves manoeuvrability while floating.
    Every truck uses the same NWH tyres, water drag, buoyancy and air limits.


    ARCADE
    AIR

    Your real snorkel intake must be ABOVE the actual water surface and
    unobstructed to replenish air. Otherwise a14-second gauge drains. Surfacing pockets
    between short submerged sections restore4seconds of air per second. Follow markers,
    dive under low trunks, then surface; a longer shallow branch on the right avoids
    the middle deep shortcut. Rain changes shared surface grip; water depth stays
    fixed.


    FAILURE IS RECOVERABLE

    At empty air, the engine sputters and
    stalls for2s, then returns to the LAST VALID SAFE checkpoint, never forward,
    with a5-second penalty. Genuine stranding has the same recovery. More than three
    recoveries or a240s race cap is DNF. Other racers continue independently. Ordered
    flags prevent shortcuts; the whole course must be traversed.


    Three races,4/3/2/1
    placement points; DNF zero. Highest cumulative total wins; tied leaders run an
    extra race. Rematch retains names/colors/input and difficulty. Per-human stable
    chase views follow below the water with hysteresis, camera-local depth fog/refraction
    and readable route markers. Bubbles, sediment, snorkels and headlamps show real
    depth; no global blue screen. One listener; each submerged truck engine is filtered
    separately. Pause/disconnect preserves all bodies, air, score and clock. Offline
    only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
